  "lesson": {
    "language": "zh-CN",
    "meta": "交互解题 · 几何概型",
    "title": "长方体 $ABCD$-$A_1B_1C_1D_1$ 中，$AB=AD=5$，$AA_1=1$，点 $M$ 满足 $3\\overrightarrow{AM}+2\\overrightarrow{BM}=\\vec 0$。在正方形 $ABCD$ 内随机取点 $P$，$P$ 到直线 $A_1D_1$ 的距离为 $d_1$，$PM$ 长为 $d_2$，求事件 $d_1-d_2\\ge 1$ 的概率",
    "answerLabel": "事件 $d_1-d_2\\ge 1$ 的概率",
    "answerValue": "$\\dfrac{S}{25}$"
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "title": "建系并定位 $M$",
      "content": "<p>$A$ 为原点，$AB$、$AD$、$AA_1$ 沿坐标轴，正方形边长 $5$，高 $1$。</p><p>$3(M-A)+2(M-B)=\\vec 0$ 得 $5M=3A+2B$，故 $M$ 在 $AB$ 上且 $AM=2$：</p>$$M(2,0,0),\\quad A_1D_1:\\ (0,t,1).$$",
      "highlight": [
        "Axis",
        "Plane_ABCD",
        "Point_M",
        "Line_A1D1",
        "Len_AB",
        "Len_AA1"
      ],
      "cameraPos": {
        "x": 12.18,
        "y": 6.55,
        "z": 9.46
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "把事件写成平面区域",
      "content": "<p>设 $P=(x,y,0)$，$0\\le x,y\\le 5$。则</p>$$d_1=\\sqrt{x^{2}+1},\\qquad d_2=\\sqrt{(x-2)^{2}+y^{2}}.$$<p>不等式 $d_1-d_2\\ge 1$ 等价于 $d_2\\le \\sqrt{x^{2}+1}-1$（右边非负）。两边平方并整理：</p>$$y^{2}\\le 4x-2-2\\sqrt{x^{2}+1}.$$",
      "highlight": [
        "Point_P",
        "Point_M",
        "Point_H",
        "Line_A1D1",
        "Line_PM",
        "Len_d1",
        "Plane_ABCD"
      ],
      "cameraPos": {
        "x": 12.26,
        "y": 8.87,
        "z": 6.38
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "确定 $x$ 的范围并求面积",
      "content": "<p>右边 $\\ge 0$ 当且仅当 $x\\ge \\dfrac{4}{3}$。在 $[4/3,5]$ 上 $\\sqrt{4x-2-2\\sqrt{x^{2}+1}}<5$，故 $y$ 从 $0$ 积到该根式即可。</p><p>有利区域面积</p>$$S=\\int_{4/3}^{5}\\sqrt{4x-2-2\\sqrt{x^{2}+1}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x,$$<p>样本空间是边长 $5$ 的正方形，面积 $25$。所求概率为 $\\dfrac{S}{25}$。</p>",
      "highlight": [
        "Plane_ABCD",
        "Point_P",
        "Point_M",
        "Line_PM"
      ],
      "cameraPos": {
        "x": 10.24,
        "y": 9.53,
        "z": 8.65
      }
    }
  ],
